    "%lld 条已改好，%lld 条没改成——列表已按服务器现状刷新，你核对一下。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 条已改好，%lld 条没改成——列表已按服务器现状刷新，你核对一下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 條已改好，%lld 條沒改成——清單已按伺服器現況刷新，你核對一下。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld changed, %lld didn't — the list has been refreshed from the server; please check it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」正被这些地方用着：%@。先去改掉，再回来删。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」正被这些地方用着：%@。先去改掉，再回来删。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」正被這些地方用著：%@。先去改掉，再回來刪。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is still used by: %@. Change those first, then come back to delete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
